{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064562/block/singleImage/3271624/df/01M7RKCH8FTR3AMQKA30N94ZWV.jpg?updatedAt=1795049156\"/><figcaption>港鐵香港大學站信號設備故障，港島綫整體行車多5至8分鐘。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>港鐵於上午8時42分表示，信號設備故障已修復，港島綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。港鐵較早時，今日於上午8時17分表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，整體行車時間(總站至總站)預計需要額外5至8分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理。呼籲乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.051439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T01:57:17.686708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:16.356928+00:00","content_hash":"e06ed26b4973255fdb7eba1e3d124b2232e267f55f89f1650d9b656be10a4527","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.051439+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}